   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "In the dining room, Max is showing off to the waitresses with a story about a famous French actor who loved his cooking. Of course, none of it is true. Let's hear his story in Russian first.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Жерар Депардье доедает моё блюдо и говорит.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
